 "notes": "SIGNATURE. Coil, snap, coil, and a guard counter that wraps: the only whip with a defensive answer, which is the thing the class was defined by not having.\n\nLineage: hide — Plaited hide and living root-tendril alike. WHP has four weapons, so it is a single-lineage class, for the same reason as FST.\nMandatory slots present: 25/25. Total slots: 33.\nart.1/art.2 trigger: the schema's trigger block cannot express a chord, so the declared button is 'two_hand' with modifier hold/double_tap. The runtime conjunction is 'heavy pressed while two_hand is HELD' (art.1) and 'heavy HELD while two_hand is HELD' (art.2) — game/data/weapons/input-map.json is authoritative and machine-readable."
}
